{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1510.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"18a782eb0f0cecb7c65f8c41f7779e285ee7893fa164f38118d0c1d20026d39d","ja":"海外デビュー？","zh":"海外出道？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1510.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"4a4fbbc17e7d248d88b2c89adba593531f8c1a648f3de07b6a00bcddfedb2129","ja":"そして、楽屋挨拶を終えて……","zh":"然后，结束了后台问候……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1510.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"600327739676f8a6ea27dcd0ee1c65a0c54cf089ccf673e69912b27c61a0d710","ja":"楽しかった～！　まさか、私達の舞台を\n見に来てくれてた人もいたなんて！","zh":"太开心了～！真没想到，居然还有人\n之前就来看过我们的舞台！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1510.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"a50b01d5ec152391483b3976d3259286529875c043fc88f447a28aa8558e3d58","ja":"さっきのステージも、褒めてもらえたわね。","zh":"刚才的舞台演出，也受到了夸奖呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1510.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"08f7b44d42cd5f2c4450870f1806c69ac7667e90bbf3041e37c7e608a5ad0721","ja":"……自分から話しかけてなかったら、\nこんな話、聞けなかったかも。","zh":"……要不是自己主动搭话，\n可能就听不到这些话了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1510.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"2d671c0d5584077c5ec99c2859fee46067884e1d0f534c095c716c77d6627018","ja":"知ってる日本語を交えて\n話してくださった方もいらっしゃいましたね♪","zh":"也有人特意夹杂着自己懂的日语\n来和我们说话呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1510.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"3e150751373046c477b2b5d74b18f4ef42e9e1e424efb45c888ca4efed1b6626","ja":"なんだか、\nすごく応援してくれてた感じだったよね？","zh":"总觉得，\n大家好像都非常支持我们呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1510.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"119e5e0c649b41629a2bf13eb2c836a3a2bb7c35b6bb6ab5f31e2f2fc724c726","ja":"はい！　「あなたたちなら海外でもいけるよ」と\nおっしゃっていただいて……。","zh":"是的！对方夸奖我们说\n“如果是你们的话，在海外也能吃得开哦”……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1510.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"aa0067f6a5d16e172a3e43c70af7e57f2b42092375ef0c31d89a26b323ad24a7","ja":"それって、海外デビューできそうってこと！？\nワールドツアーするとか！？","zh":"这意思是，有可能在海外出道了吗！？\n还要办世界巡演什么的吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1510.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"766247958678163d76ecd9197632e2cb32b6ea91939595c055992109915c9e3c","ja":"それは、さすがに飛躍しすぎじゃないかしら？","zh":"那也未免跳跃得太厉害了吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1510.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"1b50ffd2fb97b95c5a708264edb1ba20dfd3166705060fe140109475dd29a808","ja":"そんなことないよ～！　実際に海外で活躍してる人が\nすすめてくれたんだから♪","zh":"才没有那回事呢～！毕竟这可是实际在海外\n大展身手的人向我推荐的嘛♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1510.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"e80652bcf496653ac5a52ab8d5b954cc9ab5116bc63f67a31ab57aa423ce8409","ja":"海外進出かあ……私たちの歌を世界中に\nお届けするなんて、なんだかワクワクしちゃうね♪","zh":"走向世界啊……要把我们的歌声传达给\n全世界，总觉得好让人心潮澎湃呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1510.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"18de9e1462c6adc4d362dff371f20853dec800b6fa08bbda608d3b84e235e047","ja":"はい。努力していれば、\nいつか実現できると思います♪","zh":"是的。只要一直在努力，\n我觉得总有一天会实现的♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1510.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"be450834efc1c6026495d35bd2f68ab41fb0ff106f61c755381776b12a791979","ja":"それなら……エミリーはともかく、\n私達はもっと英語を勉強しておかないとね。","zh":"既然这样……艾米莉姑且不论，\n我们不多学点英语可不行呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1510.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"1545aaf5c646da6d6583e307fe143a31c1d887aed1b56279095f2f9f6648b460","ja":"いずれは世界一周ツアーなんかもしちゃって～……\nって、えっ、勉強しないといけないの！？","zh":"总有一天还要去办世界巡回演出之类的～……\n等等，诶，还得学习吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1510.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"9357f2e477a20ed78d940dee895a024a7aab342ddf2231721dd13e2b91c3448f","ja":"世界で活躍するなら、\n英語で日常会話くらいはこなせないと。でしょ？","zh":"要想活跃在世界舞台，\n至少得能用英语进行日常交流吧。对吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1510.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"e6ec5111be0be5aa57427e04aae768a45d1f98115b79d0ed6390bf3faa2b70c7","ja":"せっかくその気になったんだし、\nエミリーに特別講義をお願いしてみる？","zh":"既然都难得有这个兴致了，\n要不要请艾米莉办一场特别讲座呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1510.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"bdb748bf9debb599d8dc555678d1a89f96562407d17ed3c177e33587b6526bb5","ja":"あ……え、え～っと～…………。","zh":"啊……那个，呃…………。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1510.unity3d","item_key":"commands[49].text","source_sha256":"048f4327416c7c257ce6ba7ccf89b4598925602690511aba616cb4322d16051f","ja":"か、海外デビューは、\nもうちょっと先でいい、かな～？　……でへへへ～。","zh":"走向、走向世界……\n还是等以后再说吧～？……嘿嘿嘿嘿～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
